      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تخارشت الكِلَابُ</span></b> , (A, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّنَانِيرُ</span>, (A,)
<i>The dogs,</i> and <i>the cats,</i> [<i>scratched,</i> or] <i>fought
and assailed,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهارشت</span>, K, TA,) <i>and lacerated,</i> or
<i>tore, one another.</i> (TA.)

